  article.portfolio-about
    .inner-wrapper.flex-row-wrap.two-col
      .about-intro-box.box
        h1 Stephen Young
        p Full Stack JavaScript Developer

        .about-bio
          p I'm a tech enthusiast with a passion for blending education and technology to create meaningful experiences. I graduated from Rutgers University with a B.A. in Philosophy and a minor in Economics, and I completed the App Academy part-time immersive coding bootcamp. At NPower I diagnosed and resolved more than 50 complex technical issues across hardware, software, and networking. I also founded a robotics club that taught 30+ students to code, build, and innovate. I hold Google IT Support Specialist, Google Project Management, and AWS Cloud Practitioner certifications, and I love solving problems with code.

